# Leave these out to run in demo mode (pick a name and role; data stays on this device).
# VITE_SIGN_IN=email turns on sign-in with an emailed code. It needs the server (/api) connected,
# or practice mode: `VITE_SIGN_IN=email npm run dev:shared` prints each code in the terminal.
VITE_SIGN_IN=
VITE_API_BASE=/api
